WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.940
Learn to solve a given one-step equation using manipulatives and describe orally, the

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.221
meaning of a given one-step equation with one unknown

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:15.689
Solve n plus 8 equals 33. The answer is 25. Undo addition: n equals 25.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:22.565
If n plus 11 equals 36, how many counters represent n? Pause and solve it in your

00:00:22.565 --> 00:00:23.275
exercise book.

00:00:24.117 --> 00:00:28.703
The answer is 25. 36 minus 11 equals 25.
